{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110363","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110363/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110363/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110363/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110363","id":3399818034,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6nrZ2w","number":110363,"title":"Increase precision of SpotLight attenuation calculation to avoid driver bug on Intel devices","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","number":23,"title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":4,"created_at":"2025-09-09T20:19:08Z","updated_at":"2025-09-16T14:58:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-16T14:54:35Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110363","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110363","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110363.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110363.patch","merged_at":"2025-09-16T14:54:35Z"},"body":"On at least one intel integrated device (Intel Xe) I get a nasty precision bug when using the mobile renderer\r\n\r\n<img width=\"981\" height=\"819\" alt=\"Screenshot from 2025-09-09 12-00-47\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/08f7ee22-3891-46c5-ab1c-18101178cd7b\" />\r\n\r\nI have tested on another device and the issue seems to be specific to this GPU. Most likely this is a shader code gen error in the driver (it could also be a bug with how FP16 is handled by Intel integrated GPUs). \r\n\r\nWe have two options:\r\n1. Disable FP16 on this device (i.e. maintain a ban list)\r\n2. Avoid FP16 in this situation. \r\n\r\nI opted to avoid FP16 in this situation because I doubt that FP 16 is helping this specific code very much anyway. \r\n\r\nThis PR forces us to do 1 dot product, 1 max, operation, and 2 subtract operations in high precision that would normally be done at half precision. It also potentially adds an extra half register for most of this function. I say \"potentially\" since it's not guaranteed that a given compiler would pack `spot_dir` into a register with another variable anyway. \r\n\r\nAs a trade off. This PR avoids 3 conversions from `vec3()` to `hvec3()`, 1 conversion from `float` to `half`, and 2 conversions from `half` to `float`.\r\n\r\nOverall profiling doesn't reveal any obvious performance difference. So the impact on performance is inconclusive and likely it is highly device dependent. \r\n\r\nSince the changes are minimal and the performance impact is inconclusive. I think we should go ahead with this PR. It is extremely bad for people to ship games and have them randomly look horrible on certain devices.\r\n\r\n_After this PR_\r\n\r\n<img width=\"792\" height=\"769\" alt=\"Screenshot from 2025-09-09 13-16-55\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/09100b77-0478-48ab-94b9-28424a2639a6\" />\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110363/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110363/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}